abstract: >-
  Evidence-first orchestration core for agents, metacognitive memory,
  scientific research, reverse engineering, video production and MCP tools.
  The project separates implementation, tests, renders, benchmarks, external
  validation and editorial acceptance, and refuses to promote one level to
  another without verifiable artifacts.
